{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"text\": \"那种熟悉的亲近忽然回来，他觉得向往的生活就在眼前；身体先一紧，才反应过来那种生活还没回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"熟悉的亲近\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他想起当初不肯再等，是不愿看着珍惜的东西继续受损；光在心里怀念，护不住它们。\",\n      \"key\": \"珍惜的东西\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他想再投入，却不敢毫无顾忌，怕硬撑磨掉刚找回的温柔，最后只剩逼自己往前，顾不上想留住的生活。\",\n      \"key\": \"刚找回的温柔\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他原以为想清当初为何不能再等，就能安心往前；如今又怕争取时磨掉温柔，还是定不下来。\",\n      \"key\": \"定不下来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R32\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-1\", \"S07-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留真实安宁让他看见向往的生活尚未实现、不能满足于只在心里拥有的意思。补出熟悉的亲近重新浮现、身体先于意识察觉现实落差的过程。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R33\", \"R34\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"把不能只靠怀念改变现实与当初不肯再等的真实理由合在一起，让行动必要性来自他不愿看着珍惜的东西继续受损，而不是先讲一般道理再补回忆。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R35\"],\n      \"now\": [],\n      \"what\": \"删除\",\n      \"why\": \"对刚刚沉浸安宁的自责没有带来新的心理原因，也没有必要把享受真实的满足写成过错。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R36\", \"R37\", \"R38\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-3\", \"S07-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他已不能毫无顾忌地投入、害怕硬撑磨掉刚找回的温柔，以及最终只剩逼迫自己向前、顾不上所求生活的恐惧。把留下的风险并入S07-2，把行动的风险写入S07-3，不再用对称的两难句重复。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R39\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S07-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"保留理由更多却更难安定的变化，具体写出当初不肯再等的理由与如今害怕磨掉温柔的顾虑如何同时存在，并接回最初以为找到足够理由就能消除犹豫的困境。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4d6e2f3b-f77d-41c1-86b5-380b6c097433", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T001736009848Z", "elapsed_seconds": 103.281, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:19:19.289706+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5bd4274db1cf98810511c70040ef1c32e9ffaa140b90d08644eec1fb8b3dfddd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa238850000257